grief related to functional decline,

7d86c170-ec0c-4f0a-9fb8-1a2e3ca000e5-4
00:27:08.217 --> 00:27:11.199
and difficulty adjusting to serious or
progressive illness.

4d7d5581-0f53-4eaa-8c5a-3d2996946099-0
