And whereas existential distress is
common among patients with life

4d7d5581-0f53-4eaa-8c5a-3d2996946099-1
00:27:14.843 --> 00:27:18.606
threatening or life limiting medical
conditions and may substantially impair

4d7d5581-0f53-4eaa-8c5a-3d2996946099-2
