particularly when distress is related to
loss of meaning of life, fear of death,

75f4d004-0d6d-4b23-878f-62a1444125a9-3
00:27:56.513 --> 00:27:59.202
demoralization,
or spiritual suffering in the context of

75f4d004-0d6d-4b23-878f-62a1444125a9-4
00:27:59.202 --> 00:28:00.240
life limiting illness.

d9426260-6c91-4148-a02a-705247d774d1-0
00:28:00.960 --> 00:28:04.482
And whereas randomized clinical part
trials in patients with life threatening

d9426260-6c91-4148-a02a-705247d774d1-1
00:28:04.482 --> 00:28:08.231
cancer have demonstrated that psilocybin
assisted psychotherapy can produce rapid,

d9426260-6c91-4148-a02a-705247d774d1-2
00:28:08.231 --> 00:28:10.896
clinically meaningful and sustained
reductions in anxiety,

d9426260-6c91-4148-a02a-705247d774d1-3
