in a structured therapeutic setting with
preparation,

d9426260-6c91-4148-a02a-705247d774d1-5
00:28:16.541 --> 00:28:18.799
monitored administration and integration
support.

c96dd963-56b2-4625-b095-9b763e28ea6c-0
00:28:19.160 --> 00:28:23.213
And whereas in a randomized, double-blind,
placebo-controlled crossover trial at

c96dd963-56b2-4625-b095-9b763e28ea6c-1
00:28:23.213 --> 00:28:26.867
John Hopkins University involving
patients with life threatening cancer,

c96dd963-56b2-4625-b095-9b763e28ea6c-2
00:28:26.867 --> 00:28:30.770
psilocybin produced substantial and
sustained decreases in depressed mood and

c96dd963-56b2-4625-b095-9b763e28ea6c-3
00:28:30.770 --> 00:28:34.424
anxiety along with improvements in
