c96dd963-56b2-4625-b095-9b763e28ea6c-5
00:28:37.627 --> 00:28:40.280
follow up in substantial proportion of
participants.

50f012e5-a006-4db2-89e5-f1541980816b-0
00:28:40.920 --> 00:28:44.921
Whereas in a randomized, double-blind,
placebo-controlled crossover trial at New

