79fe3022-1dc2-4731-9e00-6d4ab627a328-0
00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:42.912
And WHEREAS recent reviews of psilocybin
assisted therapy for existential distress

79fe3022-1dc2-4731-9e00-6d4ab627a328-1
00:29:42.912 --> 00:29:46.361
and serious illness conclude that the
