WHEREAS cluster headache is a primary

0b5f444d-bda7-4873-9074-5c0cbe23ad5e-1
00:43:23.818 --> 00:43:27.021
headache disorder characterized by
excruciating unilateral pain and

0b5f444d-bda7-4873-9074-5c0cbe23ad5e-2
