autonomic symptoms,
often referred to as suicide headaches

0b5f444d-bda7-4873-9074-5c0cbe23ad5e-3
00:43:29.801 --> 00:43:33.240
due to the severity of the attacks in the
high rate of patient distress.

b7a02927-c789-47f6-9076-6a6957335997-0
00:43:33.560 --> 00:43:36.291
And whereas,
current steadative care treatments

b7a02927-c789-47f6-9076-6a6957335997-1
00:43:36.291 --> 00:43:40.785
including high flow oxygen triptans and
prophylactic agents like verapamil and

b7a02927-c789-47f6-9076-6a6957335997-2
00:43:40.785 --> 00:43:44.256
lithium are insufficient,
contraindicated or associated with

b7a02927-c789-47f6-9076-6a6957335997-3
00:43:44.256 --> 00:43:46.760
significant side effects for many
patients.

0ce2e381-e2ab-4a2d-871c-9181b41f39dc-0
00:43:46.760 --> 00:43:50.706
And whereas preliminary survey data first
identified A specialized pulse dosing

0ce2e381-e2ab-4a2d-871c-9181b41f39dc-1
00:43:50.706 --> 00:43:53.321
protocols,
subalucinogenic or low dose psilocybin as

0ce2e381-e2ab-4a2d-871c-9181b41f39dc-2
00:43:53.321 --> 00:43:57.120
an effective method for terminating
cluster periods and extending remission.

4ba659ab-359f-4492-b1d0-d47406ca327f-0
00:43:57.600 --> 00:44:01.174
And whereas follow up large scale user
surveys confirm that patients reported

4ba659ab-359f-4492-b1d0-d47406ca327f-1
00:44:01.174 --> 00:44:04.794
psilocybin to be more effective than
