0d422083-7c7e-4054-8e58-680d2a98ffe9-0
00:44:07.440 --> 00:44:10.656
WHEREAS, double-blind,
placebo-controlled pilot studies have

0d422083-7c7e-4054-8e58-680d2a98ffe9-1
00:44:10.656 --> 00:44:14.189
demonstrated that oral psilocybin
significantly reduces the weekly

0d422083-7c7e-4054-8e58-680d2a98ffe9-2
00:44:14.189 --> 00:44:16.878
frequency of clusters attacks compared to
