0d422083-7c7e-4054-8e58-680d2a98ffe9-3
00:44:16.878 --> 00:44:20.200
with the benefits persisting for weeks
after only a few doses.

0be322c0-cfae-49bf-a15b-0a6aaf6ef69c-0
00:44:20.200 --> 00:44:22.961
And WHEREAS,
subsequent clinical research has further

0be322c0-cfae-49bf-a15b-0a6aaf6ef69c-1
00:44:22.961 --> 00:44:25.774
characterized the dose relation response
relationship,

0be322c0-cfae-49bf-a15b-0a6aaf6ef69c-2
00:44:25.774 --> 00:44:29.967
suggesting that the therapeutic effect on
headache frequency may be distinct from

0be322c0-cfae-49bf-a15b-0a6aaf6ef69c-3
00:44:29.967 --> 00:44:32.320
the acute psychedelic or mystical
experience.

09a224cf-385f-46b0-821b-f9ded8c416e4-0
00:44:32.320 --> 00:44:32.480
And.

e56a16db-cad0-425d-b059-d2848b337f45-0
